  "reasoning": "The defendant caused a forest fire by careless use of fire while sweeping a grave. This resulted in the burning of 8.4 hectares of forest land. The conduct constitutes negligent arson (过失放火罪) under Chinese criminal law, which is labeled as “放火”. No other criminal elements (e.g., theft, kidnapping, fraud) are present in the facts, so the only appropriate charge is 放火.",
